Workflow automation
When task enters “in progress” → suggest branch
When branch pushed → suggest draft PR
When PR opened → run Codex review
When check fails → assign Claude/Codex fix task
When PR merged → update milestone and changelog
When release shipped → mark related tasks done

This is where real smoothness happens.

