branch protection awareness
secrets redaction
safe prompt boundaries
repo allowlist
model usage logs
cost tracking
AI permission levels
Suggest only
Draft artifacts only
Create branches
Open draft PRs
Review PRs
Auto-fix safe failures
Never merge without human approval, at least initially
